# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Vitis Unified (2025.2) workspace .gitignore
#
# Tracked components (whitelist below):
#   driver/ctu_can_fd                   shared CTU CAN FD driver
#   CTU_CAN_FD_Double_Node_Wrapper      platform, two-node system
#   CTU_CAN_FD_DUAL_NODE_FIRMWARE       app, two-node TX/RX test
#   CTU_CAN_FD_LOOPBACK_2TX_ILA131072   platform, single node + ILA
#   CTU_CAN_FD_ILA_Firmware             app, single-node loopback test
#
# Keep: app sources, vitis-comp.json, UserConfig.cmake, lscript.ld,
#       the platform's .xsa, BSP/domain settings (*.yaml, *.cmake),
#       launch configs, and scripts/.
# Ignore: everything Vitis regenerates (build/, export/, logs/, BSP
#       libsrc/lib/include, sdt/ device tree output, workspace _ide/).
#
# The Vivado project lives in its own repo:
#   ../../RTL/CTU_CAN_Ascon  (github.com/danalexandru26/CTU_CAN_Ascon)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Whitelist: ignore everything at the top level except these ---
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/scripts/
!/driver/
!/CTU_CAN_FD_Double_Node_Wrapper/
!/CTU_CAN_FD_DUAL_NODE_FIRMWARE/
!/CTU_CAN_FD_LOOPBACK_2TX_ILA131072/
!/CTU_CAN_FD_ILA_Firmware/
# To track another component (e.g. AES_SOC), add a line: !/AES_SOC/

# --- Generic build output (any component) ---
build/
export/
logs/
Debug/
Release/
.Xil/
*.o
*.d
*.obj
*.elf
*.elf.size
*.log
*.jou
*.lock
*.bin
*.pdi
*.bit
*.ltx
*.str
.vitisWorkspace.json
_rebuild_ws/

# --- clangd / IntelliSense caches ---
.cache/
.clangd
.compile_commands/
compile_commands.json

# --- Workspace / component IDE state ---
.metadata/
.rigel_lopper/
**/_ide/*
# keep the debug/run launch configs, drop the copied bitstream & psinit
!**/_ide/launch.json

# --- Platforms: hw/sdt is regenerated from the .xsa ---
**/hw/sdt/

# --- Platform BSPs: keep settings, drop generated library sources/objects ---
**/bsp/libsrc/
**/bsp/lib/
**/bsp/include/
**/bsp/hw_artifacts/
**/zynq_fsbl_bsp/libsrc/
**/zynq_fsbl_bsp/lib/
**/zynq_fsbl_bsp/include/
**/zynq_fsbl_bsp/hw_artifacts/

# --- Editor / OS junk ---
*.swp
*~
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
